  "introWelcomeTitle": "Welcome to YAMT",
  "introWelcomeBody": "Track what you eat, learn what your body really burns, and keep your kitchen in order.",
  "introStartAction": "Get started",
  "introLoginAction": "I already have an account",
  "introCalorieModelTitle": "It all starts with what you put in.",
  "introCalorieModelBody": "Your weight follows a simple equation: the energy you eat against the energy your body burns. Eat more than you burn and you gain. Eat less and you lose.",
  "introInputQualityTitle": "Your body is a furnace that never sleeps.",
  "introInputQualityBody": "Around the clock you burn energy: for your heartbeat, your brain, your breathing and steady warmth. On top comes every small motion of the day — stairs, fidgeting, shivering, walking.",
  "introFollowTargetTitle": "Your scale corrects the estimate.",
  "introFollowTargetBody": "After the first seven days we compare that starting value with how your weight actually moved, and correct it. Then again week after week.",
  "introGoalDirectionBody": "To lose weight we subtract calories from your burn, to gain weight we add some. To maintain, your target simply matches it.",
  "introGoalDirectionTitle": "Your goal bends the number.",
  "introTrendTitle": "One weigh-in says nothing. The week says everything.",
  "introTrendBody": "Water, salt and a late dinner move the scale by a kilo overnight. That is noise, not fat.",
  "introExtrasTitle": "And the rest of your kitchen comes along.",
  "introExtrasBody": "Save recipes and plan with a shopping list, scan barcodes to see what is in stock, take food off a receipt, or describe it and let the AI fill in the details.",
  "introIdentityTitle": "First we need a rough picture of you.",
  "introIdentitySubtitle": "Before the app learns your real numbers, we need a scientific starting point for your basal metabolism.",
  "introBirthDateLabel": "Birthday",
  "introBirthDateEmpty": "Please pick your birthday.",
  "introCalorieModelHighlight": "what you put in",
  "introCalorieModelNote": "The food half of the equation is tangible: what you eat can be weighed, seen and logged almost to the gram.",
  "introInputQualityHighlight": "never sleeps",
  "introInputQualityNote": "The catch: nobody can measure that burn directly. So we begin with a starting value, estimated from your details.",
  "introFollowTargetHighlight": "corrects the estimate",
  "introFollowTargetNote": "So the first week is a measurement, not a verdict. Do not read too much into it.",
  "introGoalDirectionHighlight": "bends the number",
  "introGoalDirectionNote": "You pick the pace. We do the arithmetic every single day.",
  "introTrendHighlight": "The week says everything",
  "introTrendNote": "That is why the correction reads the trend across the whole week, so a bad morning never rewrites your plan.",
  "introExtrasHighlight": "the rest of your kitchen",
  "introExtrasNote": "Logging stops being homework when the food is already in the app.",
  "introSummarySubtitle": "This is your estimated starting value. From your start day YAMT compares your food with your weight for seven days and corrects the number, then again every week.",
  "introBodyTitle": "What are your current numbers?",
  "introBodySubtitle": "Body weight and height decide how many cells have to be supplied with oxygen and glucose at rest.",
  "introWeightKgUnit": "kg",
  "introSportTitle": "On which days do you train?",
  "introSportSubtitle": "Every session counts toward your energy use. Training days get it, rest days a little less.",
  "introWeekDepotTitle": "Calories per day across the week",
